# no line-ending conversion: every checkout has the committed bytes, so the
# files built into the executables (translations, the shader, the skin
# catalog) are the same on Windows, whatever git's core.autocrlf says there
# (reproducible builds, docs/BUILDING.md)
* -text
# shell scripts run on the Windows runners too (bash cannot read CRLF)
*.sh text eol=lf
